SUMMARY:🎬Movie: Mortal Kombat 2 -  Food & Drinks after the movie 🍿!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎬 Le
 t’s Go to the Movies (and Actually Talk… or Not)\n\nWhether you're a f
 ilm nerd\, popcorn enthusiast\, or just looking for a chill night out with
  interesting people — this one's for you.\n\nWe’re heading out to see 
 a movie together\, then grabbing food or drinks after. If the film's great
